Explanation:
Functions used: groupby(), mean(), sum().
Usage: groupby() to group by subject, sum() to aggregate totals, mean() to calculate averages
Interpretation: Flawed code suggests Channel A wins with 35.0,but corrected analysis shows Channel B converts better (20.0 vs 11.0).
